/*	Check out this original unicode glyph scheme for sprite names!
	A simplified name-desc with game/filesystem accepted characters. Each decor group [asset]/*.png for better asset mgmt and editor UI naming.
	Characters render 🗹 in-game, 🗹 explorer.exe (win10), 🗹 excel (2016), 🗹 notepad, but not 🗵 cmd.exe or 🗵 powershell [5] (however they will copy from cmd to wherever)
	These were 𝑚𝑒𝑡𝑖𝑐𝑢𝑙𝑜𝑢𝑠𝑙𝑦 selected for clarity and relativity, reducing long names to a few readable glyphs. Consideration towards in-game tile info box readout.

	Represented as square tiles on a grid we can use this set. In our hex-squares, we use up/down prefixes.

	High or low glyph context: ⮝ ⮟
		Rivers/paths: ║ ˭ ‗ ╝ ╚ ╔ ╗ ╦ ╩ ╣ ╠
		River endpoints: ⩓ ⩔ ⋖ ⋗
		Beaches: ◢ ◥ ◤ ◣
		Shores: ◸ ◹ ◺ ◿
		Non-decor left/right space: ▀ ▄

	Square tile dev only, unused atm:
		Grassland: ■
		Flatland: ▥
		Desert: ▤
		Mountains: ▣
		Coast, Surf, Ocean: ▨ ▧ ⬜
		// Presumes grassland
		Scrub/Woods/Forest/Thicket: ▵ △ ▲ ◆
		Swamp: ▩
		Hill: ▦
		River: ═

*/

